description: CyPro — Erste Schritte

<!--
  onboarding — defines the guided onboarding tour, using the core "tour" plugin
  (declared in tiddlywiki.info). `tour-tag` points at the tag that collects this tour's
  STEPS: every tiddler tagged $:/tags/Tour/CyproOnboarding (the tour/onboarding/*
  tiddlers) is one step, ordered by creation/list order.

  Useful fields a step tiddler can carry (see the steps/* tiddlers for examples):
    - caption          : step title shown in the tour panel
    - (body)           : the German explanation shown to the user
    - display-mode     : e.g. "fullscreen" for intro/outro steps
    - hint-selector    : CSS selector of the element to spotlight
    - hint-text        : little label on the spotlight
    - condition        : filter; step is only shown when it matches
    - step-success-filter : filter; tour advances once it matches (user did the task)
    - enter-actions    : actions run when the step is entered (e.g. navigate to a page)

  The tour can be (re)started from buttons/tour and the help overview. Styling overrides
  live in styles/tour.
-->
Interaktive Einführung in den CSP-Assistenten für Cybersicherheitsprogramme nach DVO (EU) 2019/1583.
